<title>USA: Allergan Inc Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Allergan Inc Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>IRVINE, Calif, Oct 17 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		     Sept 30,  1996	     Sept 30, 1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $	0.26	    $	0.53</p>
<p> Net			  17.3		     34.2</p>
<p> Revs			287.5		     273.6</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   66.2			65.1</p>
<p>	  9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $	0.62	    $	0.51</p>
<p> Net			  41.1		    32.9</p>
<p> Revs			835.2		    764.1</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 65.9		     64.7</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers) NOTE:Third quarter results in 1996 included previously announced special charges for restructuring costs of $28.5 million and asset write-offs of $0.3 million. Net of tax, the special charges reduced earnings by $0.31 per share.</p>
<p>Excluding the effect of the special charges in 1996 earnings per share for the third quarter were $0.57 compared with $0.53 in 1995, an increase of 8 percent.</p>
</text>
